=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"t-terms\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-underline\" style=\"--m-accent:#5a3ec8;--m-tint:#f1edfb\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-terms\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>\n    <p><em>Last updated 2026-06-02. This is sample copy provided for educational and testing purposes.</em></p>\n    <h3>1. About these terms</h3>\n    <p>These terms govern your use of the Crest Workshop website and any course materials accessed through it. By using the site you agree to them.</p>\n    <h3>2. Use of the site</h3>\n    <p>You may browse and learn for personal, non-commercial use. Please do not attempt to disrupt the site or redistribute paid materials without permission.</p>\n    <h3>3. Enrolment &amp; content</h3>\n    <p>Course descriptions are provided in good faith and may be updated over time. Where a course is free, no payment is required to access it.</p>\n    <h3>4. Intellectual property</h3>\n    <p>Unless stated otherwise, lessons, text and graphics belong to Crest Workshop or its instructors and may not be copied without consent.</p>\n    <h3>5. Liability</h3>\n    <p>The course is educational and provided &quot;as is&quot;. Crest Workshop is not liable for outcomes resulting from how the material is applied.</p>\n    <h3>6. Contact</h3>\n    <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@crestworkshop.example\">hello@crestworkshop.example</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lg-modal-overlay\" id=\"modal-cookies\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"t-cookies\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-underline\" style=\"--m-accent:#5a3ec8;--m-tint:#f1edfb\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-cookies\">Cookie Policy</h2>\n    <p><em>Last updated 2026-06-02.</em></p>\n    <h3>What cookies we use</h3>\n    <p>We use a single essential cookie to remember your cookie choice so the banner does not reappear on every visit. It is stored locally in your browser.</p>\n    <h3>What we do not use</h3>\n    <p>We do not use advertising cookies, cross-site trackers, or third-party analytics that identify you personally.</p>\n    <h3>Managing cookies</h3>\n    <p>You can clear cookies and local storage at any time from your browser settings. Declining non-essential cookies will not affect course content.</p>\n    <h3>Contact</h3>\n    <p>For privacy questions, email <a href=\"mailto:hello@crestworkshop.example\">hello@crestworkshop.example</a>.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lg-modal-overlay\" id=\"modal-contact\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"t-contact\">\n  <div class=\"lg-modal lg-skin-underline\" style=\"--m-accent:#5a3ec8;--m-tint:#f1edfb\">\n    <button class=\"lg-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n    <h2 id=\"t-contact\">Contact us</h2>\n    <p>We are happy to help with questions about the course.</p>\n    <h3>Email</h3>\n    <p><a href=\"mailto:hello@crestworkshop.example\">hello@crestworkshop.example</a></p>\n    <h3>Phone</h3>\n    <p>+46 8 555 0190</p>\n    <h3>Address</h3>\n    <p>Crest Workshop<br>11 Vasagatan<br>Stockholm, 111 20<br>Sweden</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='lg_cookie_consent';\n  var banner=document.getElementById('lg-cookie');\n  try{ if(localStorage.getItem(KEY)){ banner.classList.add('hidden'); } }catch(e){}\n  function set(v){ try{ localStorage.setItem(KEY,v); }catch(e){} banner.classList.add('hidden'); }\n  var a=document.getElementById('lg-accept'),d=document.getElementById('lg-decline');\n  if(a)a.addEventListener('click',function(){set('accepted');});\n  if(d)d.addEventListener('click',function(){set('declined');});\n  function open(id){document.getElementById(id).classList.add('open');}\n  function close(el){el.classList.remove('open');}\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal]').forEach(function(t){\n    t.addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();open(t.get